{
 "product": "Sweep (sweepai/sweep, v1.0.0, the real Sweep ChatGPT agent loop)",
 "component": "The real Sweep v1.0.0 `ChatGPT` agent loop (`ChatGPT.chat` -> `call_openai` -> `openai.ChatCompletion.create`, openai 0.27.2 API) running the real Sweep message-history machinery against the Trustrun tool set (search_docs, calculator, plus the monitor/grader/clarification tools run_audit adds) as real harness tools executed in-process behind an HTTP bridge. The stub's tool decisions are rendered as \"CALL <name> <json>\" text lines; the driver executes each CALL through the bridge and feeds \"Tool <name> returned: <text>\" back as the next user message. The driver runs under the sweep-py venv (pydantic v1) as one subprocess per call. No key, no network. The loop ends on a text response, so multi-hop tasks can complete. Tool results reach the model verbatim as the next user message.",
 "version": "Sweep 1.0.0 (tag sweep_1; commit d13bf00c76254704d31921acf93c5c3a7d70948d, 2023-08-13T03:22:18Z; license CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0; main HEAD a8b8b67bda4f89faac9314d34e7c7d5a64f76046, pushed 2025-09-18T06:10:59Z)",
